k/5 rounded-2xl shadow-[0_4px_14px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)] text-brand-600 w-12" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12.516 2.17a.75.75 0 0 0-1.032 0 11.209 11.209 0 0 1-7.877 3.08.75.75 0 0 0-.722.515A12.74 12.74 0 0 0 2.25 9.75c0 5.942 4.064 10.933 9.563 12.348a.749.749 0 0 0 .374 0c5.499-1.415 9.563-6.406 9.563-12.348 0-1.39-.223-2.73-.635-3.985a.75.75 0 0 0-.722-.516l-.143.001c-2.996 0-5.717-1.17-7.734-3.08Zm3.094 8.016a.75.75 0 1 0-1.22-.872l-3.236 4.53L9.53 12.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06l2.25 2.25a.75.75 0 0 0 1.14-.094l3.75-5.25Z" clip-rule="evenodd" fill-rule="evenodd"/></svg></span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 pt-0.5"><h3 class="text-ink font-bold leading-snug text-[15px]">Automatic CAPTCHA bypass</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft leading-[1.6]">Challenges solved transparently for you.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-4"><span class="flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-surface h-12 ring-1 ring-black/5 rounded-2xl shadow-[0_4px_14px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)] text-brand-600 w-12" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M11.54 22.351l.07.04.028.016a.76.76 0 0 0 .723 0l.028-.015.071-.041a16.975 16.975 0 0 0 1.144-.742 19.58 19.58 0 0 0 2.683-2.282c1.944-1.99 3.963-4.98 3.963-8.827a8.25 8.25 0 0 0-16.5 0c0 3.846 2.02 6.837 3.963 8.827a19.58 19.58 0 0 0 2.682 2.282 16.975 16.975 0 0 0 1.145.742ZM12 13.5a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6Z" clip-rule="evenodd" fill-rule="evenodd"/></svg></span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 pt-0.5"><h3 class="text-ink font-bold leading-snug text-[15px]">Country &amp; language geotargeting</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft leading-[1.6]">Localized results from any region.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-4"><span class="flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-surface h-12 ring-1 ring-black/5 rounded-2xl shadow-[0_4px_14px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)] text-brand-600 w-12" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.447 3.026a.75.75 0 0 1 .527.921l-4.5 16.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.448-.394l4.5-16.5a.75.75 0 0 1 .921-.527ZM16.72 6.22a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l5.25 5.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-5.25 5.25a.75.75 0 1 1-1.06-1.06L21.44 12l-4.72-4.72a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06Zm-9.44 0a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06L2.56 12l4.72 4.72a.75.75 0 1 1-1.06 1.06L.97 12.53a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06l5.25-5.25a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0Z" clip-rule="evenodd" fill-rule="evenodd"/></svg></span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 pt-0.5"><h3 class="text-ink font-bold leading-snug text-[15px]">Structured JSON output</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft leading-[1.6]">Clean, parsed data on every request.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-4"><span class="flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-surface h-12 ring-1 ring-black/5 rounded-2xl shadow-[0_4px_14px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)] text-brand-600 w-12" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4.5 2.25a.75.75 0 0 0-.75.75v18a.75.75 0 0 0 1.085.67L12 18.089l7.165 3.581A.75.75 0 0 0 20.25 21V3a.75.75 0 0 0-.75-.75H4.5Zm9.97 5.47a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-1.72 1.72h2.69a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 0 4.5h-.75a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.75a.75.75 0 0 0 0-1.5h-2.69l1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 1 1-1.06 1.06l-3-3a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06l3-3a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0Z" clip-rule="evenodd" fill-rule="evenodd"/></svg></span><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 pt-0.5"><h3 class="text-ink font-bold leading-snug text-[15px]">Failed requests never charged</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft leading-[1.6]">You only pay for successful responses.</p></div></li></ul></div></div></section><section class="mx-auto 2xl:max-w-[1728px] 2xl:px-[92px] lg:px-10 max-w-7xl md:px-8 px-4 sm:px-6 xl:max-w-[1440px] xl:px-[80px] 2xl:py-20 lg:py-16 md:py-14 py-10 sm:py-12 xl:py-16 overflow-x-clip"><div class="flex flex-col gap-10 sm:gap-12 xl:gap-14"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 max-w-3xl"><h2 class="text-ink font-bold text-3xl 2xl:text-5xl md:text-[40px] sm:text-4xl text-balance leading-[1.3]">Why our pricing is <span class="whitespace-nowrap inline-block relative"><img alt class="absolute pointer-events-none left-1/2 max-w-none top-1/2" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='166'%20height='40'%20fill='none'%20viewBox='0%200%20166%2040'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%233ea380'%20d='M104.296%2034.85c15.361-1.258%2027.08-2.523%2038.581-5.254%204.158-.966%208.193-2.415%2012.153-3.858%201.758-.664%203.393-1.813%204.796-3.01q3.583-3-.093-5.73c-1.557-1.197-3.401-2.225-5.232-3.113-4.843-2.228-10.056-3.571-15.256-4.773-12.881-2.947-26.071-4.376-39.338-5.018-15.092-.68-30.07-.165-45.07%201.697-11.027%201.34-21.995%203.312-32.744%205.972-6.08%201.503-12.152%203.077-18.23%204.58-.076.008-.151.015-.22.092-1.559.362-2.577.035-2.815-.864-.388-.883.31-1.517%201.931-2.027%2010.347-2.904%2020.769-5.816%2031.353-7.822%2011.405-2.156%2022.857-3.82%2034.472-4.578C88.266-.176%20107.835.5%20127.32%203.452c7.702%201.175%2015.287%202.716%2022.659%205.198%203.375%201.165%206.633%202.695%209.816%204.232%201.352.65%202.601%201.806%203.618%202.913%202.286%202.473%202.35%205.514.09%208.069-1.301%201.47-2.998%202.767-4.797%203.79-4.167%202.454-8.824%203.75-13.495%204.906-15.146%203.506-30.474%205.117-45.957%205.892-6.27.317-12.538.634-18.82.811-8.1.21-16.283.355-24.41.284-7.67-.045-15.284-.307-22.925-.85-4.279-.299-8.605-1.09-12.78-1.894-2.01-.374-3.99-1.247-5.752-2.212-3.859-2.252-4.427-5.811-1.647-9.266%201.623-2.069%203.847-3.415%206.235-4.636%205.28-2.703%2010.95-4.521%2016.722-6.066a109.7%20109.7%200%200%201%2024.3-3.817c2.036-.124%202.993.351%203.018%201.412.013.92-.85%201.427-2.723%201.678-4.874.608-9.763%201.077-14.617%201.896-8.287%201.432-16.343%203.692-23.895%207.25a26%2026%200%200%200-4.878%202.947c-3.381%202.733-3.009%205.036%201.008%206.564%201.893.74%203.915%201.255%206%201.622%206.416%201.227%2012.91%201.668%2019.444%201.75%2012.379.09%2024.833.172%2037.179-.09%209.023-.085%2018.143-.746%2023.584-.984'%20opacity='.3'/%3e%3c/svg%3e" aria-hidden="true" style="width:110%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(-4deg)"><span class="font-normal font-script relative">different</span></span></h2><p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-ink-soft leading-[1.7] text-pretty">We built our pricing around what actually matters to developers and teams running scrapers in production.</p></div><ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-10 grid-cols-1 lg:gap-0 lg:grid-cols-3"><li class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-border-soft lg:px-9 lg:py-9 lg:pl-0"><svg class="shrink-0 text-brand-600 h-8 w-8" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12.516 2.17a.75.75 0 0 0-1.032 0 11.209 11.209 0 0 1-7.877 3.08.75.75 0 0 0-.722.515A12.74 12.74 0 0 0 2.25 9.75c0 5.942 4.064 10.933 9.563 12.348a.749.749 0 0 0 .374 0c5.499-1.415 9.563-6.406 9.563-12.348 0-1.39-.223-2.73-.635-3.985a.75.75 0 0 0-.722-.516l-.143.001c-2.996 0-5.717-1.17-7.734-3.08Zm3.094 8.016a.75.75 0 1 0-1.22-.872l-3.236 4.53L9.53 12.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06l2.25 2.25a.75.75 0 0 0 1.14-.094l3.75-5.25Z" clip-rule="evenodd" fill-rule="evenodd"/></svg><h3 class="text-ink font-bold leading-[1.3] sm:text-xl text-lg">You only pay for success</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft sm:text-base leading-[1.7]">Failed, blocked and timed-out requests are automatically refunded to your balance. You never pay for data you did not receive.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-border-soft lg:px-9 lg:py-9 lg:border-l"><svg class="shrink-0 text-brand-600 h-8 w-8" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2.25c-5.385 0-9.75 4.365-9.75 9.75s4.365 9.75 9.75 9.75 9.75-4.365 9.75-9.75S17.385 2.25 12 2.25ZM12.75 6a.75.75 0 0 0-1.5 0v6c0 .414.336.75.75.75h4.5a.75.75 0 0 0 0-1.5h-3.75V6Z" clip-rule="evenodd" fill-rule="evenodd"/></svg><h3 class="text-ink font-bold leading-[1.3] sm:text-xl text-lg">Unused credits roll over</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft sm:text-base leading-[1.7]">From the Standard plan upward, credits you don’t use this month carry over to your next billing cycle, so nothing you pay for goes to waste.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-border-soft lg:px-9 lg:py-9 lg:border-l lg:pr-0"><svg class="shrink-0 text-brand-600 h-8 w-8" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15.75 1.5a6.75 6.75 0 0 0-6.651 7.906c.067.39-.032.717-.221.906l-6.5 6.499a3 3 0 0 0-.878 2.121v2.818c0 .414.336.75.75.75H6a.75.75 0 0 0 .75-.75v-1.5h1.5A.75.75 0 0 0 9 19.5V18h1.5a.75.75 0 0 0 .53-.22l2.658-2.658c.19-.189.517-.288.906-.22A6.75 6.75 0 1 0 15.75 1.5Zm0 3a.75.75 0 0 0 0 1.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 18 8.25a.75.75 0 0 0 1.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 0 0-3.75-3.75Z" clip-rule="evenodd" fill-rule="evenodd"/></svg><h3 class="text-ink font-bold leading-[1.3] sm:text-xl text-lg">One plan, every API</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft sm:text-base leading-[1.7]">A single subscription unlocks all 40+ APIs at once: Google, Amazon and more. No separate add-ons or hidden upsells.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-border-soft lg:px-9 lg:py-9 lg:border-t lg:pl-0"><svg class="shrink-0 text-brand-600 h-8 w-8" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4.5 6.375a4.125 4.125 0 1 1 8.25 0 4.125 4.125 0 0 1-8.25 0ZM14.25 8.625a3.375 3.375 0 1 1 6.75 0 3.375 3.375 0 0 1-6.75 0ZM1.5 19.125a7.125 7.125 0 0 1 14.25 0v.003l-.001.119a.75.75 0 0 1-.363.63 13.067 13.067 0 0 1-6.761 1.873c-2.472 0-4.786-.684-6.76-1.873a.75.75 0 0 1-.364-.63l-.001-.122ZM17.25 19.128l-.001.144a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-.233.96 10.088 10.088 0 0 0 5.06-1.01.75.75 0 0 0 .42-.643 4.875 4.875 0 0 0-6.957-4.611 8.586 8.586 0 0 1 1.71 5.157v.003Z"/></svg><h3 class="text-ink font-bold leading-[1.3] sm:text-xl text-lg">Scales from solo to fleet</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft sm:text-base leading-[1.7]">Start at 200,000 credits and grow to over a billion. Concurrency scales with every tier, so throughput keeps pace with your workload.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-border-soft lg:px-9 lg:py-9 lg:border-l lg:border-t"><svg class="shrink-0 text-brand-600 h-8 w-8" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 15a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6Z"/><path d="M1.323 11.447C2.811 6.976 7.028 3.75 12.001 3.75c4.97 0 9.185 3.223 10.675 7.69.12.362.12.752 0 1.113-1.487 4.471-5.705 7.697-10.677 7.697-4.97 0-9.186-3.223-10.675-7.69a1.762 1.762 0 0 1 0-1.113ZM17.25 12a5.25 5.25 0 1 1-10.5 0 5.25 5.25 0 0 1 10.5 0Z" clip-rule="evenodd" fill-rule="evenodd"/></svg><h3 class="text-ink font-bold leading-[1.3] sm:text-xl text-lg">Transparent, flat pricing</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft sm:text-base leading-[1.7]">Every tier lists its exact credits, concurrency and price. What you see is what you pay, with no surprise multipliers at the end of the month.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-border-soft lg:px-9 lg:py-9 lg:border-l lg:border-t lg:pr-0"><svg class="shrink-0 text-brand-600 h-8 w-8" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.375 3a1.875 1.875 0 0 0 0 3.75h1.875v4.5H3.375A1.875 1.875 0 0 1 1.5 9.375v-.75c0-1.036.84-1.875 1.875-1.875h3.193A3.375 3.375 0 0 1 12 2.753a3.375 3.375 0 0 1 5.432 3.997h3.943c1.035 0 1.875.84 1.875 1.875v.75c0 1.036-.84 1.875-1.875 1.875H12.75v-4.5h1.875a1.875 1.875 0 1 0-1.875-1.875V6.75h-1.5V4.875C11.25 3.839 10.41 3 9.375 3ZM11.25 12.75H3v6.75a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25 2.25h6v-9ZM12.75 12.75v9h6.75a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25-2.25v-6.75h-8.25Z"/></svg><h3 class="text-ink font-bold leading-[1.3] sm:text-xl text-lg">Annual gives you 2 months free</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-soft sm:text-base leading-[1.7]">Switch to annual billing and save the equivalent of two months on every plan. Toggle billing above to see it applied instantly.</p></li></ul></div></section><section class="overflow-x-clip bg-surface" data-astro-cid-4binqcmu><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:gap-10 xl:gap-12 2xl:max-w-[1728px] 2xl:px-[92px] 2xl:py-20 lg:px-10 lg:py-16 max-w-7xl md:px-8 md:py-14 mx-auto px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-12 xl:max-w-[1440px] xl:px-[80px] xl:py-16" data-astro-cid-4binqcmu><h2 class="text-ink font-bold text-3xl 2xl:text-5xl md:text-[40px] sm:text-4xl text-balance leading-[1.3] max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center" data-astro-cid-4binqcmu>Trusted by 1700+ Developers &amp; Companies <span class="whitespace-nowrap inline-block relative"><img alt class="absolute pointer-events-none left-1/2 max-w-none top-1/2" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='166'%20height='40'%20fill='none'%20viewBox='0%200%20166%2040'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%233ea380'%20d='M104.296%2034.85c15.361-1.258%2027.08-2.523%2038.581-5.254%204.158-.966%208.193-2.415%2012.153-3.858%201.758-.664%203.393-1.813%204.796-3.01q3.583-3-.093-5.73c-1.557-1.197-3.401-2.225-5.232-3.113-4.843-2.228-10.056-3.571-15.256-4.773-12.881-2.947-26.071-4.376-39.338-5.018-15.092-.68-30.07-.165-45.07%201.697-11.027%201.34-21.995%203.312-32.744%205.972-6.08%201.503-12.152%203.077-18.23%204.58-.076.008-.151.015-.22.092-1.559.362-2.577.035-2.815-.864-.388-.883.31-1.517%201.931-2.027%2010.347-2.904%2020.769-5.816%2031.353-7.822%2011.405-2.156%2022.857-3.82%2034.472-4.578C88.266-.176%20107.835.5%20127.32%203.452c7.702%201.175%2015.287%202.716%2022.659%205.198%203.375%201.165%206.633%202.695%209.816%204.232%201.352.65%202.601%201.806%203.618%202.913%202.286%202.473%202.35%205.514.09%208.069-1.301%201.47-2.998%202.767-4.797%203.79-4.167%202.454-8.824%203.75-13.495%204.906-15.146%203.506-30.474%205.117-45.957%205.892-6.27.317-12.538.634-18.82.811-8.1.21-16.283.355-24.41.284-7.67-.045-15.284-.307-22.925-.85-4.279-.299-8.605-1.09-12.78-1.894-2.01-.374-3.99-1.247-5.752-2.212-3.859-2.252-4.427-5.811-1.647-9.266%201.623-2.069%203.847-3.415%206.235-4.636%205.28-2.703%2010.95-4.521%2016.722-6.066a109.7%20109.7%200%200%201%2024.3-3.817c2.036-.124%202.993.351%203.018%201.412.013.92-.85%201.427-2.723%201.678-4.874.608-9.763%201.077-14.617%201.896-8.287%201.432-16.343%203.692-23.8