574-20.64%204.363%204.363%200%2000-.919-6.093'%3e%3c/path%3e%3cpath%20fill='%23252A31'%20d='M170.112%2051.312a8.414%208.414%200%20015.574%202.1%203.009%203.009%200%20001.734.594%202.44%202.44%200%20002.475-2.514%202.517%202.517%200%2000-.828-1.823%2012.579%2012.579%200%2000-8.954-3.426c-8.015%200-13.612%205.677-13.612%2013.807s5.6%2013.808%2013.612%2013.808a12.554%2012.554%200%20008.939-3.413%202.54%202.54%200%2000.844-1.836%202.44%202.44%200%2000-2.475-2.515%203.086%203.086%200%2000-1.776.625%208.424%208.424%200%2001-5.532%202.072c-4.8%200-8.154-3.594-8.154-8.74s3.353-8.739%208.154-8.739m27.043%2017.616c-5.415%200-8.248-4.466-8.248-8.876%200-5.827%204.15-8.875%208.248-8.875%205.417%200%208.252%204.465%208.252%208.875%200%205.827-4.151%208.876-8.252%208.876m0-22.683a13.446%2013.446%200%2000-13.689%2013.807%2013.689%2013.689%200%201027.378%200%2013.446%2013.446%200%2000-13.689-13.807m43.244.155a2.621%202.621%200%2000-2.365%201.592l-8.46%2017.715-.074-.156-8.48-17.595a2.58%202.58%200%2000-2.385-1.556%202.525%202.525%200%2000-2.553%202.553V71.11a2.573%202.573%200%20105.146%200V59.338l6.106%2012.94a2.315%202.315%200%20002.243%201.424%202.417%202.417%200%20002.247-1.437l6.023-12.925v11.809a2.573%202.573%200%20005.146%200V48.994A2.454%202.454%200%2000240.4%2046.4'%3e%3c/path%3e%3c/svg%3e" decoding="async" height="120" width="243" data-astro-cid-4binqcmu loading="lazy"> </a><a href="https://lockin.bot/" class="flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 h-10 logo-cell md:h-12 md:w-[150px] sm:h-12 sm:w-[140px] w-[120px]" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" data-astro-cid-4binqcmu aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img alt="Lockin Bot" class="max-h-full max-w-full object-contain" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," decoding="async" height="48" width="260" data-astro-cid-4binqcmu loading="lazy"></a></div></div></div></section><section class="mx-auto 2xl:max-w-[1728px] 2xl:px-[92px] lg:px-10 max-w-7xl md:px-8 px-4 sm:px-6 xl:max-w-[1440px] xl:px-[80px] overflow-x-clip 2xl:pb-20 lg:pb-16 md:pb-14 pb-10 sm:pb-12 xl:pb-16"><div class="flex items-start bg-gradient-to-r flex-col from-brand-500 gap-6 p-8 rounded-2xl sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:p-10 to-black"><div class="flex gap-3 flex-col sm:gap-4"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold leading-[1.3] text-balance text-surface md:text-[34px] sm:text-3xl">Not sure which plan suits you?</h2><p class="text-sm text-[#F2F4F7] font-semibold">Our team will assist you in selecting the right plan.</p></div><a href="mailto:info@scrapingdog.com" class="shrink-0 items-center justify-center bg-surface duration-200 ease-out-soft focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-current focus-visible:outline-offset-2 font-bold gap-2 group/btn h-[50px] hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_12px_28px_rgba(0,0,0,0.28)] inline-flex px-8 rounded-button shadow-button sm:min-w-[200px] sm:w-auto text-base text-brand-text transition-all w-full" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Contact Sales <svg class="ease-out-soft duration-200 transition-transform group-hover/btn:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="18" width="18"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a></div></section><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How do credits work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Credits are shared across every API on your plan, and each API has its own credit cost — the full per-API list is on the documentation page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What happens if I run out of credits?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Once your credits are used up, API requests return an over-limit response until they reset on your next billing date. You can upgrade your plan at any time from the dashboard and the new credits are available immediately."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I upgrade or downgrade at any time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, at any time. Either way you pay the full amount for the new plan, so nothing is prorated. On an upgrade your unused credits roll over to the new plan; on a downgrade your credits are reset to the new plan&rsquo;s allowance."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you charge for failed or blocked requests?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Failed, blocked and timed-out requests are automatically credited back to your balance. You only ever pay for data you successfully receive."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do all plans include every API?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. One subscription unlocks all 40+ APIs including Google Search, Maps, Amazon and our LLM-ready data endpoints. There are no separate add-on purchases."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer a free trial?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Every account starts with 100 free credits and full access to all APIs, no credit card required. Test the service end to end before choosing a plan."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Need more than the listed plans?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We build custom plans for high-volume and enterprise workloads, with dedicated infrastructure and a named account manager. Reach out to our team and we will tailor a plan to your exact volume."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does annual billing save me money?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Annual billing is priced at ten months for twelve, the equivalent of two months free on every plan. Use the Monthly / Annual toggle to see the discounted price applied to each tier."}}]}</script><section class="mx-auto 2xl:max-w-[1728px] 2xl:px-[92px] lg:px-10 max-w-7xl md:px-8 px-4 sm:px-6 xl:max-w-[1440px] xl:px-[80px] 2xl:py-20 lg:py-16 md:py-14 py-10 sm:py-12 xl:py-16 overflow-x-clip"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:gap-10 xl:gap-12"><div class="flex flex-col"><h2 class="text-ink font-bold text-3xl 2xl:text-5xl md:text-[40px] sm:text-4xl text-balance leading-[1.3]">Frequently Asked <span class="whitespace-nowrap inline-block relative"><img alt class="absolute pointer-events-none left-1/2 max-w-none top-1/2" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='166'%20height='40'%20fill='none'%20viewBox='0%200%20166%2040'%3e%3cpath%20fill='%233ea380'%20d='M104.296%2034.85c15.361-1.258%2027.08-2.523%2038.581-5.254%204.158-.966%208.193-2.415%2012.153-3.858%201.758-.664%203.393-1.813%204.796-3.01q3.583-3-.093-5.73c-1.557-1.197-3.401-2.225-5.232-3.113-4.843-2.228-10.056-3.571-15.256-4.773-12.881-2.947-26.071-4.376-39.338-5.018-15.092-.68-30.07-.165-45.07%201.697-11.027%201.34-21.995%203.312-32.744%205.972-6.08%201.503-12.152%203.077-18.23%204.58-.076.008-.151.015-.22.092-1.559.362-2.577.035-2.815-.864-.388-.883.31-1.517%201.931-2.027%2010.347-2.904%2020.769-5.816%2031.353-7.822%2011.405-2.156%2022.857-3.82%2034.472-4.578C88.266-.176%20107.835.5%20127.32%203.452c7.702%201.175%2015.287%202.716%2022.659%205.198%203.375%201.165%206.633%202.695%209.816%204.232%201.352.65%202.601%201.806%203.618%202.913%202.286%202.473%202.35%205.514.09%208.069-1.301%201.47-2.998%202.767-4.797%203.79-4.167%202.454-8.824%203.75-13.495%204.906-15.146%203.506-30.474%205.117-45.957%205.892-6.27.317-12.538.634-18.82.811-8.1.21-16.283.355-24.41.284-7.67-.045-15.284-.307-22.925-.85-4.279-.299-8.605-1.09-12.78-1.894-2.01-.374-3.99-1.247-5.752-2.212-3.859-2.252-4.427-5.811-1.647-9.266%201.623-2.069%203.847-3.415%206.235-4.636%205.28-2.703%2010.95-4.521%2016.722-6.066a109.7%20109.7%200%200%201%2024.3-3.817c2.036-.124%202.993.351%203.018%201.412.013.92-.85%201.427-2.723%201.678-4.874.608-9.763%201.077-14.617%201.896-8.287%201.432-16.343%203.692-23.895%207.25a26%2026%200%200%200-4.878%202.947c-3.381%202.733-3.009%205.036%201.008%206.564%201.893.74%203.915%201.255%206%201.622%206.416%201.227%2012.91%201.668%2019.444%201.75%2012.379.09%2024.833.172%2037.179-.09%209.023-.085%2018.143-.746%2023.584-.984'%20opacity='.3'/%3e%3c/svg%3e" aria-hidden="true" style="width:115%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(-5.5deg)"><span class="font-normal font-script relative">Questions</span></span></h2></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-start"><ul class="flex flex-col flex-1 gap-4"><li><div class="bg-surface-card group rounded-2xl" data-collapse data-open="false"><button class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-transparent cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-current focus-visible:outline-offset-4 justify-between p-5 sm:p-6 text-left w-full" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-1" data-collapse-trigger><span class="text-ink text-base font-semibold leading-[1.5]">How do credits work? </span><svg class="shrink-0 h-4 text-brand-500 duration-200 ease-out-soft group-data-[open=true]:rotate-180 mt-1 transition-transform w-auto" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 17" height="17" width="15"><path d="M7.72559 15.75L7.72559 0.75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M1.70124 9.70019L7.72524 15.7502L13.7502 9.7002" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><div class="ease-out-soft duration-300 grid grid-rows-[0fr] group-data-[open=true]:grid-rows-[1fr] transition-[grid-template-rows]" id="faq-panel-1" data-collapse-panel inert><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="text-sm text-ink-soft sm:text-base leading-[1.7] [&_a:hover]:underline [&_a]:font-semibold [&_a]:text-brand-text [&_p:last-child]:mb-0 [&_p]:mb-3 [&_strong]:font-semibold [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:my-3 [&_ul]:pl-5 [&_ul_li:last-child]:mb-0 [&_ul_li]:mb-2 pb-5 px-5 sm:pb-6 sm:px-6">Credits are shared across every API on your plan, and each API has its own credit cost — the full per-API list is on the <a href="/documentation/">documentation page</a>.</div></div></div></div></li><li><div class="bg-surface-card group rounded-2xl" data-collapse data-open="false"><button class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-transparent cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-current focus-visible:outline-offset-4 justify-between p-5 sm:p-6 text-left w-full" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-2" data-collapse-trigger><span class="text-ink text-base font-semibold leading-[1.5]">What happens if I run out of credits? </span><svg class="shrink-0 h-4 text-brand-500 duration-200 ease-out-soft group-data-[open=true]:rotate-180 mt-1 transition-transform w-auto" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 17" height="17" width="15"><path d="M7.72559 15.75L7.72559 0.75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M1.70124 9.70019L7.72524 15.7502L13.7502 9.7002" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><div class="ease-out-soft duration-300 grid grid-rows-[0fr] group-data-[open=true]:grid-rows-[1fr] transition-[grid-template-rows]" id="faq-panel-2" data-collapse-panel inert><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="text-sm text-ink-soft sm:text-base leading-[1.7] [&_a:hover]:underline [&_a]:font-semibold [&_a]:text-brand-text [&_p:last-child]:mb-0 [&_p]:mb-3 [&_strong]:font-semibold [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:my-3 [&_ul]:pl-5 [&_ul_li:last-child]:mb-0 [&_ul_li]:mb-2 pb-5 px-5 sm:pb-6 sm:px-6">Once your credits are used up, API requests return an over-limit response until they reset on your next billing date. You can upgrade your plan at any time from the dashboard and the new credits are available immediately.</div></div></div></div></li><li><div class="bg-surface-card group rounded-2xl" data-collapse data-open="false"><button class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-transparent cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-current focus-visible:outline-offset-4 justify-between p-5 sm:p-6 text-left w-full" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-3" data-collapse-trigger><span class="text-ink text-base font-semibold leading-[1.5]">Can I upgrade or downgrade at any time? </span><svg class="shrink-0 h-4 text-brand-500 duration-200 ease-out-soft group-data-[open=true]:rotate-180 mt-1 transition-transform w-auto" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 17" height="17" width="15"><path d="M7.72559 15.75L7.72559 0.75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M1.70124 9.70019L7.72524 15.7502L13.7502 9.7002" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><div class="ease-out-soft duration-300 grid grid-rows-[0fr] group-data-[open=true]:grid-rows-[1fr] transition-[grid-template-rows]" id="faq-panel-3" data-collapse-panel inert><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="text-sm text-ink-soft sm:text-base leading-[1.7] [&_a:hover]:underline [&_a]:font-semibold [&_a]:text-brand-text [&_p:last-child]:mb-0 [&_p]:mb-3 [&_strong]:font-semibold [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:my-3 [&_ul]:pl-5 [&_ul_li:last-child]:mb-0 [&_ul_li]:mb-2 pb-5 px-5 sm:pb-6 sm:px-6">Yes, at any time. Either way you pay the full amount for the new plan, so nothing is prorated. On an upgrade your unused credits roll over to the new plan; on a downgrade your credits are reset to the new plan&rsquo;s allowance.</div></div></div></div></li><li><div class="bg-surface-card group rounded-2xl" data-collapse data-open="false"><button class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-transparent cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-current focus-visible:outline-offset-4 justify-between p-5 sm:p-6 text-left w-full" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-4" data-collapse-trigger><span class="text-ink text-base font-semibold leading-[1.5]">Do you charge for failed or blocked requests? </span><svg class="shrink-0 h-4 text-brand-500 duration-200 ease-out-soft group-data-[open=true]:rotate-180 mt-1 transition-transform w-auto" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 17" height="17" width="15"><path d="M7.72559 15.75L7.72559 0.75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M1.70124 9.70019L7.72524 15.7502L13.7502 9.7002" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><div class="ease-out-soft duration-300 grid grid-rows-[0fr] group-data-[open=true]:grid-rows-[1fr] transition-[grid-template-rows]" id="faq-panel-4" data-collapse-panel inert><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="text-sm text-ink-soft sm:text-base leading-[1.7] [&_a:hover]:underline [&_a]:font-semibold [&_a]:text-brand-text [&_p:last-child]:mb-0 [&_p]:mb-3 [&_strong]:font-semibold [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:my-3 [&_ul]:pl-5 [&_ul_li:last-child]:mb-0 [&_ul_li]:mb-2 pb-5 px-5 sm:pb-6 sm:px-6">No. Failed, blocked and timed-out requests are automatically credited back to your balance. You only ever pay for data you successfully receive.</div></div></div></div></li></ul><ul class="flex flex-col flex-1 gap-4"><li><div class="bg-surface-card group rounded-2xl" data-collapse data-open="false"><button class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-transparent cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-current focus-visible:outline-offset-4 justify-between p-5 sm:p-6 text-left w-full" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-5" data-collapse-trigger><span class="text-ink text-base font-semibold leading-[1.5]">Do all plans include every API? </span><svg class="shrink-0 h-4 text-brand-500 duration-200 ease-out-soft group-data-[open=true]:rotate-180 mt-1 transition-transform w-auto" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 17" height="17" width="15"><path d="M7.72559 15.75L7.72559 0.75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M1.70124 9.70019L7.72524 15.7502L13.7502 9.7002" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><div class="ease-out-soft duration-300 grid grid-rows-[0fr] group-data-[open=true]:grid-rows-[1fr] transition-[grid-template-rows]" id="faq-panel-5" data-collapse-panel inert><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="text-sm text-ink-soft sm:text-base leading-[1.7] [&_a:hover]:underline [&_a]:font-semibold [&_a]:text-brand-text [&_p:last-child]:mb-0 [&_p]:mb-3 [&_strong]:font-semibold [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:my-3 [&_ul]:pl-5 [&_ul_li:last-child]:mb-0 [&_ul_li]:mb-2 pb-5 px-5 sm:pb-6 sm:px-6">Yes. One subscription unlocks all 40+ APIs including Google Search, Maps, Amazon and our LLM-ready data endpoints. There are no separate add-on purchases.</div></div></div></div></li><li><div class="bg-surface-card group rounded-2xl" data-collapse data-open="false"><button class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-transparent cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-current focus-visible:outline-offset-4 justify-between p-5 sm:p-6 text-left w-full" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-6" data-collapse-trigger><span class="text-ink text-base font-semibold leading-[1.5]">Do you offer a free trial? </span><svg class="shrink-0 h-4 text-brand-500 duration-200 ease-out-soft group-data-[open=true]:rotate-180 mt-1 transition-transform w-auto" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 17" height="17" width="15"><path d="M7.72559 15.75L7.72559 0.75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M1.70124 9.70019L7.72524 15.7502L13.7502 9.7002" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><div class="ease-out-soft duration-300 grid grid-rows-[0fr] group-data-[open=true]:grid-rows-[1fr] transition-[grid-template-rows]" id="faq-panel-6" data-collapse-panel inert><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="text-sm text-ink-soft sm:text-base leading-[1.7] [&_a:hover]:underline [&_a]:font-semibo