n to your exact volume.</div></div></div></div></li><li><div class="bg-surface-card group rounded-2xl" data-collapse data-open="false"><button class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-transparent cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-current focus-visible:outline-offset-4 justify-between p-5 sm:p-6 text-left w-full" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-8" data-collapse-trigger><span class="text-ink text-base font-semibold leading-[1.5]">How does annual billing save me money? </span><svg class="shrink-0 h-4 text-brand-500 duration-200 ease-out-soft group-data-[open=true]:rotate-180 mt-1 transition-transform w-auto" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 17" height="17" width="15"><path d="M7.72559 15.75L7.72559 0.75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M1.70124 9.70019L7.72524 15.7502L13.7502 9.7002" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><div class="ease-out-soft duration-300 grid grid-rows-[0fr] group-data-[open=true]:grid-rows-[1fr] transition-[grid-template-rows]" id="faq-panel-8" data-collapse-panel inert><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="text-sm text-ink-soft sm:text-base leading-[1.7] [&_a:hover]:underline [&_a]:font-semibold [&_a]:text-brand-text [&_p:last-child]:mb-0 [&_p]:mb-3 [&_strong]:font-semibold [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:my-3 [&_ul]:pl-5 [&_ul_li:last-child]:mb-0 [&_ul_li]:mb-2 pb-5 px-5 sm:pb-6 sm:px-6">Annual billing is priced at ten months for twelve, the equivalent of two months free on every plan. Use the Monthly / Annual toggle to see the discounted price applied to each tier.</div></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div></section><section class="mx-auto 2xl:max-w-[1728px] 2xl:px-[92px] lg:px-10 max-w-7xl md:px-8 px-4 sm:px-6 xl:max-w-[1440px] xl:px-[80px] 2xl:py-20 lg:py-16 md:py-14 py-10 sm:py-12 xl:py-16 overflow-x-clip"><div class="overflow-hidden relative bg-gradie